---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout
  title="CelluReva: Hustle to Healing Book | Art of Self-Healthcare"
  description="Hustle to Healing by Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra reveals how chronic stress, burnout, and disease begin at the cellular level—and how true healing starts from within. Discover the CelluReva protocol."
  keywords="CelluReva, Hustle to Healing, Dr Biswajit Mohapatra, Art of Self-Healthcare, Self Healthcare Education, Cellular Health, Burnout Recovery, No Prescription Point"
>
  <!-- SEO Open Graph and Twitter Card tags -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="CelluReva: Hustle to Healing Book | Art of Self-Healthcare" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Discover how chronic stress and burnout begin at the cellular level and how Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra's CelluReva protocol guides you back to health." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,w=1440,h=756,fit=crop,f=jpeg/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/brn00005-fkHy051JoVjOMZGZ.JPG" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="book" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.globalselfhealthcare.org/hustle-to-healing" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />

  <!-- JSON-LD Book Schema for SEO -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Book",
      "name": "Hustle to Healing: Live Well to Lead Well",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra"
      },
      "image": "https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,w=450,fit=crop/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/brn00005-fkHy051JoVjOMZGZ.JPG",
      "description": "Hustle to Healing by Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra reveals how chronic stress, burnout, and disease begin at the cellular level—and how true healing starts from within.",
      "isbn": "1645465039",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "GSHER India"
      },
      "about": [
        "CelluReva",
        "Self-Healthcare",
        "Preventive Health",
        "Stress Management"
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <main class="book-page">
    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 1: Cinematic Hero Banner
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="hero-banner">
      <div class="hero-bg-image"></div>
      <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      <div class="container hero-content-wrapper">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <!-- Left: Hero Text Content -->
          <div class="hero-text-col">
            <div class="hero-brand-badge">
              <span class="badge-accent">CelluReva™</span>
              <span class="badge-divider">|</span>
              <span class="badge-text">Art of Self-Healthcare</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="hero-title">
              Hustle to Healing
              <span class="hero-subtitle">Live Well to Lead Well</span>
            </h1>

            <div class="hero-release">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Official Release &bull; 14 January 2026
            </div>

            <p class="hero-desc">
              A powerful parable of a high-performing CEO, Aryan Das, who collapses at the edge of Stage IV cancer—and discovers, with Dr. Biswajit at the No Prescription Point, that healing begins not with more medicine, but with remembering rhythm, breath, and cellular intelligence.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-tags">
              <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> 18 Chapters</span>
              <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-nodes"></i> CelluReva Framework</span>
              <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> A Modern Medical Gita</span>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-ctas">
              <a href="#booking" class="btn-primary">Pre-Order Book Now</a>
              <a href="#overview" class="btn-outline font-white">Explore Book Details</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Book Card Preview -->
          <div class="hero-preview-col">
            <div class="glass-book-card">
              <div class="glass-card-badge">Hustle to Healing Preview</div>
              <div class="glass-cover-wrap">
                <img 
                  src="https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/whatsapp-image-2025-10-19-at-3.10.03-pm-2M9AYR4EYK8yIH2x.jpeg" 
                  alt="Hustle to Healing Book Cover" 
                  class="glass-cover-img"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="glass-meta">
                <span><strong>Author:</strong> Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra, MS</span>
                <span><strong>Theme:</strong> Burnout &rarr; Awakening &rarr; Healing</span>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-quote">
                “Healing is not a miracle. It is a return to rhythm — breath, sleep, food, movement, mindset.”
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chevron">
        <a href="#overview" class="chevron-btn" aria-label="Scroll Down"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 2: Book Overview Grid
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="overview-section" id="overview">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="overview-grid">
          <!-- Text Details -->
          <div class="overview-info">
            <span class="section-tag">Why This Book</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">A Book for Everyone Standing at the Edge</h2>
            
            <p class="lead-text">
              <strong>Hustle to Healing</strong> is a narrative non-fiction journey that blends immersive storytelling, rigorous biological science, and practical self-care. It speaks directly to modern professionals who succeed outwardly while burning out inwardly—until the body finally says: <em>"Enough."</em>
            </p>

            <div class="story-teaser">
              <p>
                Aryan Das is a celebrated CEO—awards on the wall, but zero energy left in the body. Reduced to 30 kg by Stage IV cancer, he writes a desperate 3 AM message from a hospital bed to his childhood friend "Bisu"—now Dr. Biswajit, a surgeon and founder of the No Prescription Point in Odisha.
              </p>
              <p>
                What follows is not a standard "motivational" transformation. It is a practical awakening into stillness, breath, cellular intelligence, gut wisdom, and the true science of self-healthcare.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="quote-card">
              <p class="quote-text">
                "This book is not only about Aryan's illness. It is about his awakening — and yours."
              </p>
              <cite class="quote-author">&mdash; Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra</cite>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Book Cover & Quick Meta -->
          <div class="overview-visual">
            <div class="product-card">
              <div class="cover-wrapper">
                <img 
                  src="https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,w=450,fit=crop/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/brn00005-fkHy051JoVjOMZGZ.JPG" 
                  alt="Hustle to Healing Book Cover" 
                  class="book-cover-img"
                />
              </div>
              
              <div class="product-details">
                <h3 class="product-title">Hustle to Healing</h3>
                <ul class="meta-list">
                  <li><strong>Author:</strong> Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra, MS</li>
                  <li><strong>Theme:</strong> Burnout &rarr; Awakening &rarr; Cellular Healing</li>
                  <li><strong>Core Focus:</strong> Circadian Rhythm & Self-Stewardship</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 3: Who Is This Book For?
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="audience-section">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag center">Target Audience</span>
        <h2 class="section-title center">Who Is This Book Written For?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          If you identify with any of the following profiles, this book will provide you with a powerful blueprint to reclaim your health.
        </p>

        <div class="audience-grid">
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="audience-card">
            <div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i></div>
            <h3>Corporate Leaders</h3>
            <p>High-achieving executives, entrepreneurs, and professionals who push boundaries daily but ignore the warning signs of chronic physical exhaustion.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="audience-card">
            <div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor"></i></div>
            <h3>Healthcare Practitioners</h3>
            <p>Doctors, nurses, and wellness advocates interested in bridging clinical rescue operations with daily preventative self-care systems.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div class="audience-card">
            <div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i></div>
            <h3>Seekers of Transformation</h3>
            <p>Anyone struggling with chronic stress, poor sleep, or metabolic imbalances who wants to learn the biological language of cellular recovery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 4: The CelluReva Framework
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="framework-section">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag center">The Core Protocol</span>
        <h2 class="section-title center">The CelluReva™ Framework</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          The underlying blueprint of the book—a scientifically rooted pathway that leverages biology, rhythm, and mindfulness to restore health from the cellular level.
        </p>

        <div class="framework-grid">
          <!-- Pillar 1 -->
          <div class="framework-card">
            <div class="fw-header">
              <span class="fw-num">01</span>
              <h3>RESET</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Interrupt chronic stress loops, cortisol spikes, and autopilot lifestyle habits. Terminate the active damage cycle to allow cells to rest.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Pillar 2 -->
          <div class="framework-card">
            <div class="fw-header">
              <span class="fw-num">02</span>
              <h3>REVIVE</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Recharge the body's internal battery. Focus on circadian sleep hygiene, conscious breathing, grounding, and cellular hydration.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Pillar 3 -->
          <div class="framework-card">
            <div class="fw-header">
              <span class="fw-num">03</span>
              <h3>REPROGRAM</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Upgrade belief patterns and self-identity. Change the inner operating system that normalized high-stress living and illness.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Pillar 4 -->
          <div class="framework-card">
            <div class="fw-header">
              <span class="fw-num">04</span>
              <h3>RESTORE</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Return to biological alignment. Establish a sustainable lifestyle ecosystem where personal health supports effective long-term leadership.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 5: Chapter Highlights
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="chapters-section" id="journey">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag center">18 Chapters Structure</span>
        <h2 class="section-title center font-white">The Journey of Awakening</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle font-light-muted">
          The book unfolds like a medical scripture, guiding you from systemic collapse to cellular intelligence, and finally to active health preservation.
        </p>

        <div class="phases-grid">
          <!-- Phase 1 -->
          <div class="phase-card">
            <div class="phase-badge">Phase I</div>
            <h3>The Descent into Burnout</h3>
            <p class="phase-desc">
              The early chapters mirror the modern professional life: nonstop ambition, ignored signals, and finally the crisis that forces a pause.
            </p>
            <div class="phase-topics">
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Burnout Biology</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Ignored Cellular Signals</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> The Crisis Event</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Phase 2 -->
          <div class="phase-card">
            <div class="phase-badge">Phase II</div>
            <h3>Awakening Cellular Intelligence</h3>
            <p class="phase-desc">
              Stillness, breath, attention, and self-leadership become the turning point—where healing shifts from external fixing to internal alignment.
            </p>
            <div class="phase-topics">
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Breath & Nervous System</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Stillness as Therapy</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Bio-Intelligence</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Phase 3 -->
          <div class="phase-card">
            <div class="phase-badge">Phase III</div>
            <h3>Rebuilding From the Inside Out</h3>
            <p class="phase-desc">
              Practical daily steps: nervous system regulation, food as feedback, movement as medicine, mindset reprogramming, and restoring rhythm.
            </p>
            <div class="phase-topics">
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Circadian Syncing</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Food as Biological Data</span>
              <span><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Rhythm Restoration</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 6: Booking & Quantity Discounts
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="booking-section" id="booking">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag center">Pre-Order Booking</span>
        <h2 class="section-title center">Secure Your Copies & Discounts</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Secure your copy of the official release. Tiered discounts and **free shipping** apply automatically based on your order quantity.
        </p>

        <div class="booking-layout">
          <!-- Discount Tiers -->
          <div class="booking-details-card">
            <div class="badge-label">Discount Structure</div>
            
            <table class="discount-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Quantity Selected</th>
                  <th>Discount Percentage</th>
                  <th>Shipping Cost</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>1–4 copies</td>
                  <td class="discount-hl">8% Discount</td>
                  <td class="free-shipping">FREE Shipping</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>5–9 copies</td>
                  <td class="discount-hl">12% Discount</td>
                  <td class="free-shipping">FREE Shipping</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>10–19 copies</td>
                  <td class="discount-hl">17% Discount</td>
                  <td class="free-shipping">FREE Shipping</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>20+ copies</td>
                  <td class="discount-hl">25% Discount</td>
                  <td class="free-shipping">FREE Shipping</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="bulk-notice">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
              <span>
                <strong>Corporate/Institutional Orders:</strong> For bulk distributions or corporate gifting, please proceed with your purchase using the booking button and leave a note, or contact the GSHER team directly.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Checkout Box -->
          <div class="checkout-card">
            <h3>Confirm Pre-Order</h3>
            <p>Click below to navigate to the secure Razorpay payment gateway to confirm your copy.</p>

            <a href="https://rzp.io/rzp/h2hbook" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary block-btn">
              Buy via Razorpay <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>

            <div class="pay-links-info">
              <span><strong>Alternative purchase:</strong> <a href="https://www.amazon.in/Care-Your-Health-Manual-Healthy/dp/1645465039/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a></span>
              <span><strong>Gateway Link:</strong> https://rzp.io/rzp/h2hbook</span>
            </div>

            <div class="next-steps-list">
              <h4>What Happens Next?</h4>
              <ul>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-caret-right"></i> Complete your checkout safely on Razorpay.</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-caret-right"></i> Our delivery team verifies your address and order details.</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-caret-right"></i> Free shipping is applied to all discounted orders.</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-caret-right"></i> Delivery starts immediately around the release window.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 7: About the Author
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="author-section">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag center">About the Author</span>
        <h2 class="section-title center">Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra &mdash; The Cell Care Doctor</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Senior Surgeon &bull; Founder of No Prescription Point &bull; Chairman of GSHER Trust &bull; Pioneer of Cellular Health Protocols
        </p>

        <div class="author-grid-layout">
          <!-- Image -->
          <div class="author-image-box">
            <img 
              src="https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,w=600,h=800,fit=crop/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/img_1063-AzGOPqQz18fqkDNL.JPG" 
              alt="Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra Photo" 
              class="author-photo-img"
            />
            <div class="experience-badge">28+ Years Experience</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bio Details -->
          <div class="author-bio-card">
            <h3>Dr. Biswajit Mohapatra, MS</h3>
            <p class="author-tagline">Surgeon &bull; Health Educator &bull; Leader of the Self-Healthcare Movement</p>
            
            <p>
              Throughout his extensive surgical career, Dr. Biswajit observed a recurring, critical pattern: patients frequently reach the operating table only when their bodies have already paid a heavy price for chronic mental stress, poor circadian rhythm, and lifestyle overload.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Hustle to Healing</strong> is his core narrative manifesto for modern professionals—building an active bridge between advanced clinical medicine and daily, proactive self-care.
            </p>
            
            <div class="quote-callout">
              "We must shift our minds from chasing disease management to active cellular stewardship."
            </div>

            <div class="author-link-wrap">
              <a href={`${base}/about`} class="btn-outline">Read Full Surgeon Biography <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         Section 8: Bottom CTA Banner
         ========================================== -->
    <section class="bottom-cta-banner">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Your cells have been whispering. It's time to listen.</h2>
        <p>Join the movement from ambition to alignment, from chronic stress to deep cellular recovery.</p>
        
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="https://rzp.io/rzp/h2hbook" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">Buy Book Now</a>
          <span class="release-text">Official Release: 14 January 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<!-- ==========================================
     Scoped Stylesheet (Mobile-First CSS)
     ========================================== -->
<style>
  :root {
    --color-primary-teal: var(--color-primary);
    --color-teal-hover: var(--color-primary-dark);
    --color-mint-light: var(--color-primary-light);
    --color-accent-gold: var(--color-accent);
    --color-dark-grey: var(--color-text-dark);
    --color-light-grey: var(--color-bg-alt);
    --color-border-grey: rgba(32, 107, 62, 0.12);
  }

  /* Base/Mobile styles */
  .book-page {
    background-color: var(--cr-cream);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .font-white {
    color: #ffffff !important;
  }
  
  .font-light-muted {
    color: var(--color-text-light-muted) !important;
  }

  /* Utility components */
  .section-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section-tag.center {
    display: table;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 5vw, 34px);
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-title.center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 16px);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-banner {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 0 80px 0;
    color: #ffffff;
    background-color: #0b2216;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-bg-image {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-image: url('https://assets.zyrosite.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto/dWxnO74qGGcN789B/whatsapp-image-2025-10-19-at-3.10.03-pm-2M9AYR4EYK8yIH2x.jpeg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.1;
    filter: blur(20px);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(11, 34, 22, 0.92), rgba(8, 24, 15, 0.98));
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* RESET values inherited from global index.css */
  .hero-content-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    top: auto;
    left: auto;
    transform: none;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-text-col {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-brand-badge {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .badge-accent {
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .badge-divider {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  .badge-text {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #ffffff !important; /* Explicit override of global H1 color */
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 22px);
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .hero-release {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background-color: var(--color-tertiary);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.9;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
  }

  .hero-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .hero-tags .tag {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50px;
    display: inline-flex;
